{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/9852eb99e3823dc527002c0a93f6c88f.poster.avif?t=1773486653\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/9852eb99e3823dc527002c0a93f6c88f.webm?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/9852eb99e3823dc527002c0a93f6c88f.mp4?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Protect your team by forcing enemies to attack you in this single-player action roguelite inspired by MMO raids. Create unique builds, unlock powerful talents and master the art of tanking to command the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Hold your foes' attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/60d7436fb9982dcf3fd298375575e3a3.poster.avif?t=1773486653\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/60d7436fb9982dcf3fd298375575e3a3.webm?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/60d7436fb9982dcf3fd298375575e3a3.mp4?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage your enemies to hold their attention! Or force them to attack you by running away! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro lets you play any kind of tank you can think of, focusing on control, strategy and positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Your Companions<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/ab267173ee1342a7ca54f7705918fbfd.avif?t=1773486653\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the assignment of protecting your group from harm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions, while alive, provide powerful abilities that can be upgraded, which are key for a successful run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro allows you to choose whether to protect your companions or go full hard-core and sacrifice them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/72dcee018ec81fb4e6c8e9dd78649de7.avif?t=1773486653\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to utilize the tank you aim to become. Charge can close a gap between you and the enemy but if you're the slower type, you can always pull them towards you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abilities are aggressive and focus on damage, whilst others focus on protection and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/3d2cc79d1123bafbbaa37b72074b6bea.avif?t=1773486653\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your lasting tanking builds by spending talent points to suit your preferred playstyle. Play as a Dodger, Blocker, Kiter, or Taunter - each with distinct mechanics and upgrade paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the lava-surrounded Isle of Doom, survive the Cyclone Sands' sandstorms, and face the final challenge in &quot;The Fallen City.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock new arenas and fight new enemies &amp; bosses to prove your tanking skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3079160?t=1773486653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/4c40432e302ee8cb7c2b69356f8874e79072e3a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773486653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/1ed6d964f597a0b573f712047f5389e15e4daf5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773486653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/1ed6d964f597a0b573f712047f5389e15e4daf5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773486653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3086530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/9852eb99e3823dc527002c0a93f6c88f.poster.avif?t=1773486653\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/9852eb99e3823dc527002c0a93f6c88f.webm?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/9852eb99e3823dc527002c0a93f6c88f.mp4?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Protect your team by forcing enemies to attack you in this single-player action roguelite inspired by MMO raids. Create unique builds, unlock powerful talents and master the art of tanking to command the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Hold your foes' attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/60d7436fb9982dcf3fd298375575e3a3.poster.avif?t=1773486653\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/60d7436fb9982dcf3fd298375575e3a3.webm?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/60d7436fb9982dcf3fd298375575e3a3.mp4?t=1773486653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage your enemies to hold their attention! Or force them to attack you by running away! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro lets you play any kind of tank you can think of, focusing on control, strategy and positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Your Companions<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/ab267173ee1342a7ca54f7705918fbfd.avif?t=1773486653\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the assignment of protecting your group from harm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions, while alive, provide powerful abilities that can be upgraded, which are key for a successful run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Lose Aggro allows you to choose whether to protect your companions or go full hard-core and sacrifice them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/72dcee018ec81fb4e6c8e9dd78649de7.avif?t=1773486653\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your abilities to utilize the tank you aim to become. Charge can close a gap between you and the enemy but if you're the slower type, you can always pull them towards you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abilities are aggressive and focus on damage, whilst others focus on protection and healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/extras/3d2cc79d1123bafbbaa37b72074b6bea.avif?t=1773486653\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your lasting tanking builds by spending talent points to suit your preferred playstyle. Play as a Dodger, Blocker, Kiter, or Taunter - each with distinct mechanics and upgrade paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the lava-surrounded Isle of Doom, survive the Cyclone Sands' sandstorms, and face the final challenge in &quot;The Fallen City.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock new arenas and fight new enemies &amp; bosses to prove your tanking skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Oren Koren"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079160/8c8d2d85d5bfe38d8d37809e7e82f692551306af/header.jpg?t=1773486653","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Oren Koren. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3079160/1508599906/89e9665486129d089838c186e3552943fe763f00/1750973064/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749293460","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3079160/1508599906/89e9665486129d089838c